OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIsolated early showers before
OL,6,Frain quickly spreads east, this
OL,7,Fbecoming heavy and perhaps thundery.
OL,8,FRain clears by early afternoon but
OL,9,Fwidespread showers quickly follow,
OL,10,Fthese often very heavy, thundery and
OL,11,Fwith gusty winds. Becoming windy along
OL,12,Fthe south coast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers, often heavy and
OL,15,Fthundery, quickly fade. Cloudy
OL,16,Fconditions follow, with some patchy
OL,17,Flight rain. Later becoming dry, with
OL,18,Fsome clear spells developing across
OL,19,Fsouthern areas. Windy along southern
OL,20,Fcoasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,171,160,301,260,100,100
