OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FBright or sunny spells and
OL,6,Fisolated showers developing. Later a
OL,7,Fband of heavy, squally and probably
OL,8,Fthundery showers reach western areas,
OL,9,Fmove east through the evening.
OL,10,FTemperatures slightly above average.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FBright
OL,13,For sunny spells and scattered showers
OL,14,FMonday and Tuesday, these sometimes
OL,15,Fheavy and thundery on Monday. Probably
OL,16,Fdry and fine Wednesday. Breezy at
OL,17,Ftimes with temperatures generally
OL,18,Faround normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
